msgid ""
"The :module:`GenerateExportHeader` "
"module's :command:`generate_export_header` command gained a "
"``CXX_ATTRIBUTES`` option to define the export, no-export and deprecation "
"macros as C++11 attributes, which, unlike the compiler-specific spellings, "
"can be combined with other C++11 attributes."
